        "quote": "(a) Services performed by divisions of the Department of Public Works for other divisions and work performed on duly established projects for other City departments shall be charged on an actual salary cost basis, plus an overhead percentage to defray the intangible costs of administration, equipment, insurances, rent and all other overhead expense, except where such overhead charges are prohibited by Federal or State regulations.",
